<title>USA: Evergreen closes $1.75 bln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Evergreen closes $1.75 bln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evergreen Media Corp said Monday it closed a new $1.75 billion, eight-year syndicated senior credit facility lead-managed by Toronto-Dominion Bank.</p>
<p>The facility replaces the company's previous $625 million facility.</p>
<p>Evergreen plans to use the new facility to finance recently announced acquisitions, including the Viacom and Gannett radio station portfolios, and as working capital and for other general corporate purposes.</p>
